<title>USA: Telco Systems Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Telco Systems Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the periods ended August 25, 1996 and August 27, 1995 Dollars in thousands except per share amounts</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Sales			 $29,621  $19,320    $93,954  $89,070</p>
<p> Cost of sales		17,987   11,052     57,285   48,559</p>
<p> Gross profit		 11,634    8,268     36,669   40,511</p>
<p>   Percent of sales	  39.3%    42.8%	39.0%    45.5%</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p>Research and development</p>
<p>				   3,788    4,892     17,991   18,207</p>
<p>Sales, marketing</p>
<p>     and administration    7,124    5,506     30,408   22,945</p>
<p>Restructuring costs</p>
<p>     (credits)		 (450)    (420)	4,209    (420)</p>
<p>Amortization of</p>
<p>     intangible assets	 166	201	  752	783</p>
<p>   Interest (income)	 (202)    (430)    (1,146)  (1,632)</p>
<p> Pretax income (loss)	1,208  ( 1,481)  ( 15,545)     628</p>
<p> Income tax (benefit)	  ---    (250)	  ---	---</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	   1,208  ( 1,231)  ( 15,545)     628</p>
<p>Average shares and</p>
<p>equivalents (thousands)</p>
<p>				  10,896   10,162     10,357   10,345</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share   .11   ( .12)    ( 1.50)	.06</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest net income included a one-time gain of $450,000 or $0.04 per share which was an adjustment to restructuring charges recorded in the third quarter.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
